#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions. Use with
#   LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<repository>/tests/lsan.supp
# An entry needs a reason that holds for every report it can match, and nothing here
# may hide a leak in this project's code.

# Theme registers the bundled fonts with QFontDatabase::addApplicationFont. On Linux Qt
# hands the font to fontconfig (FcConfigAppFontAddFile), and fontconfig keeps what it
# parsed for the life of the process and never frees it at exit. Every frame of the
# report is inside libfontconfig or libexpat below Qt's own addApplicationFont.
leak:QFontconfigDatabase::addApplicationFont
